glyphfx is a C17 port of ttfx. ttfx is a Rust port of TerminalTextEffects.
The provenance chain:

    TerminalTextEffects
    https://github.com/ChrisBuilds/terminaltexteffects
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 ChrisBuilds

    ttfx
    https://github.com/omacom/ttfx
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 37signals / omacom-io

The effect set, the animation engine's design, and the command-line interface
originate with those projects. glyphfx reproduces ttfx's behavior, including
its rendering quirks, and is validated against the ttfx binary.

ttfx is not vendored here; tools/parity/fetch_reference.sh clones it on demand.
